      "statement": "WorkflowPushGuardMiddleware gates git push commands that ship changes under .github/workflows/: it parses only a standalone operator-free git push origin refspec, inspects the sandbox repo to compute the workflow diff, diff preview, diff stats, and a content fingerprint, and lets the push proceed untouched when no workflow files changed.",
